<title>USA: Toy Biz pulls out of Marvel deal.</title>
<headline>Toy Biz pulls out of Marvel deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toy Biz Inc. said on Tuesday it terminated its letter of intent to participate in the reorganization of Marvel Entertainment Group Inc, and will withdraw from the plan filed jointly with Marvel last week in U.S. Bankruptcy Court.</p>
<p>Toy Biz said it plans to enter discussions with various parties with an interest in the Marvel bankruptcy, in hopes of reaching a new understanding that would allow Toy Biz to participate in Marvel's reorganization.</p>
</text>
